# security-gate superset probes: label line, then the command; cases separated by
# a line of ====. Placeholders keep destructive literals out of this file (see
# test-security-gate-superset.sh). A label starting with msg-body: is a git/gh
# message body, the one class the current gate may allow where de0c626 denied.
====
a/md-then-bash
cat > notes.md <<EOF
@RM@ ~
EOF
bash notes.md
====
